stream
BT
/F2 15 Tf
60 780 Td
(2. Samples and test conditions) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
0 -30 Td
15 TL
(Fuel: woven cotton fabric, 0.30 mm thick, areal density 120 g/m2.) '
(Sample size: 2 cm wide and 10 cm long, held flat in a steel frame.) '
(Ignition: a hot wire at one end of the sample, powered for 2 seconds.) '
() '
(Atmosphere: oxygen in nitrogen at 21 %, 26 %, 30 % and 34 % by volume.) '
(Pressure: 101.3 kPa \(sea level\) and 56.5 kPa \(Moon base proposal\).) '
(Flow: a gentle forced flow of 5 cm/s along the sample, opposed to the flame.) '
(Gravity: microgravity \(drop tower\) and normal gravity \(1 g\).) '
(In total 32 tests were run: 16 in microgravity and 16 in normal gravity,) '
(two repeats for each oxygen and pressure combination.) '
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
60 40 Td
(FICTIONAL TEST REPORT - written to test the Ghostflame upload feature. Not NASA data.  Page 2) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
