(4. Limitations and future work) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
0 -30 Td
15 TL
(The drop tower gives only 5.2 s of microgravity, so slow flames may not have) '
(reached a steady spread rate; spread rates below 1 mm/s are uncertain.) '
(Only one fabric and one flow speed \(5 cm/s\) were tested.) '
(No test was run at lunar gravity \(0.16 g\): the Moon case lies between the) '
(microgravity and normal gravity results.) '
(Future work: longer microgravity time on the ISS, more fabrics, and flow) '
(speeds from 1 to 20 cm/s.) '
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
60 40 Td
(FICTIONAL TEST REPORT - written to test the Ghostflame upload feature. Not NASA data.  Page 4) Tj
ET
endstream
